# The HD interface over a replay's console (docs/phase-replay.md; with --data and Remastered's HD art): terran01
# played a moment and quit (Quit Mission writes LastReplay.rep), then played back as Load Replay's Ok does. A replay's
# console is nconsole.pcx, whose Remastered art is one picture (game/consoles/neutral/console.dds), not a race's three
# pieces: check hd counts the SD pixels over HD art, and tools/ci.sh wants the replay's screen with "no HD art: 0
# pixels" besides exit code 0 and "0 failures". The real clock: the HD pages load on threads.
mission terran/terran01
options originals
clock real

audit hd
wait game
wait frames 30
wait seconds 2
check hd "game"
shot game
menu quit-mission
wait dialog quit2mnu
activate ok
wait frames 10

replay "LastReplay"
wait game and replay
wait frames 30
wait seconds 2
check hd "replay"
shot replay
